{"nodes": [{"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_6_iteration_and_destructuring_02_loop_forms_01_what_each_iterates_page", "label": "What each loop iterates", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-6-iteration-and-destructuring/02-loop-forms/01-what-each-iterates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_6_iteration_and_destructuring_02_loop_forms_01_what_each_iterates_for_in", "label": "for...in", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-6-iteration-and-destructuring/02-loop-forms/01-what-each-iterates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Iterates enumerable string keys including inherited ones. An Object.hasOwn guard is the signal to switch to Object.keys."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_6_iteration_and_destructuring_02_loop_forms_01_what_each_iterates_for_of", "label": "for...of", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-6-iteration-and-destructuring/02-loop-forms/01-what-each-iterates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Iterates values via Symbol.iterator. Strings yield code points. Works on Map and Set directly."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_6_iteration_and_destructuring_02_loop_forms_01_what_each_iterates_foreach", "label": "Array.prototype.forEach", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/javascript/pages/phase-6-iteration-and-destructuring/02-loop-forms/01-what-each-iterates.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Index is a number. Skips holes. Cannot break. Does not await."}, {"id": "docs_javascript_pages_phase_6_iteration_and_destructuring_02_loop_forms_01_what_each_iterates_never_for_in_array", "label": "